Good. Send my regards when you do.

559
00:39:17,620 --> 00:39:21,830
帮我把鸟喂完
And, uh... finish feeding the birds, will you?

560
00:39:24,530 --> 00:39:26,190
他们今天饿了
They're starving today.

561
