你们知道科尔在哪吗
You guys know where I can find Cole?

562
00:39:55,100 --> 00:39:56,050
关你什么事
What's it to you?

563
00:40:02,770 --> 00:40:03,560
再上一层
One floor up.

564
00:40:04,680 --> 00:40:05,480
