Thanks.

565
00:40:29,600 --> 00:40:31,650
我叫你们别再闹了
Man, I told y'all to stop playing!

566
00:40:33,570 --> 00:40:35,160
我是来表示悼念的
I'm here to pay my respects.

567
00:40:38,100 --> 00:40:38,980
凯奇
Cage.

568
00:40:39,990 --> 00:40:41,490
我知道你是谁
I know who you are.

569
00:40:46,310 --> 00:40:48,770
-你认识肖恩吗  -不
- Did you know Sean? - No.

570
00:40:50,180 --> 00:40:51,700
但我认识你姐姐坎迪斯
But I knew your sister Candace.

571
00:40:52,950 --> 00:40:55,070
我猜我也是来悼念她的
I guess I'm here to pay my respects for her, too.

572
00:40:55,160 --> 00:40:56,790
这家人运气真好  是吧
This family's got some luck, huh?

573
00:40:58,810 --> 00:41:02,400
在这里  坏事往往会发生在好人身上
Around here, bad things have a tendency to happen to good people.

574
