会跟她的死有关吗
could somehow be related to hers?

576
00:41:06,570 --> 00:41:08,440
不  我觉得不...
No. I don't think...

577
00:41:10,760 --> 00:41:14,430
不  肖恩的事  更多是起意外
No, what happened to Sean was, um... was more like an accident.

578
00:41:15,370 --> 00:41:17,000
-你确定吗  -是的
- You sure about that? - Yeah.

579
