听说他找到份新工作
I heard he got a new job.

580
00:41:22,270 --> 00:41:23,750
那我可不知道
I ain't know nothing about that.

581
00:41:24,670 --> 00:41:29,030
我们不是无所不谈的  那是他的事
I mean, we didn't talk about everything. That was his business.

582
00:41:29,690 --> 00:41:30,510
当然了
Of course.

583
00:41:32,520 --> 00:41:33,420
你呢
What about you?

584
00:41:34,350 --> 00:41:35,020
什么
What?

585
