你情况似乎还不错
Things seem to be going okay.

586
00:41:41,240 --> 00:41:42,360
你也找到了新工作吗
Did you get a new gig?

587
00:41:44,410 --> 00:41:47,830
不  我现在还在找工作
No. I'm just in between stuff right now.

588
