唯一能帮我的办法就是把我也变得刀枪不入
The only way to help me is to make me bulletproof, too.

606
00:42:53,830 --> 00:42:55,300
英雄已经来迟了
It's too late for heroes.

607
00:42:57,160 --> 00:42:59,510
英雄是你说的  不是我
Hero's your word. Not mine.

608
00:43:12,460 --> 00:43:15,790
-我要我的钱  -我知道  会给你的
- I want my money. - I hear you. I'm gonna get it.

609
00:43:15,790 --> 00:43:17,780
给你到今天晚上
You got till the end of the day,

610
00:43:17,780 --> 00:43:19,840
否则我会回来  砸点东西
or I'm coming back here to bust some shit up!

611
00:43:42,120 --> 00:43:44,420
约翰·雷蒙德  我是杰西卡·琼斯
John Raymond, it's Jessica Jones.

612
00:43:45,370 --> 00:43:48,260
我在回你的电话
I'm, uh... returning your call.

613
00:43:48,260 --> 00:43:50,600
你记得你企图吓我的那通电话吗
You remember the one where you tried to scare me?

614
00:43:55,590 --> 00:43:57,990
楼下的人说你在这里的
The guy downstairs said you were here.

615
00:43:58,890 --> 00:44:00,980
哥们  我不在乎你在做什么怪事
Dude, I don't care what weird shit you're into,

616
