老天爷
Holy shit.

621
00:45:12,280 --> 00:45:13,050
谢谢
Thank you.

622
00:45:23,840 --> 00:45:27,040
我们做了安排  如你所要求
We made arrangements, as you requested.

623
00:45:29,870 --> 00:45:31,700
你确定吗
Are you certain about this?

624
00:45:32,010 --> 00:45:34,170
还有时间考虑
There's still time to think it through.

625
00:45:35,370 --> 00:45:36,250
你走吧
You can go.

626
00:45:52,250 --> 00:45:55,040
-世界上最伟大的城市  -是啊
- Greatest city in the world. - Yeah.

627
00:45:55,950 --> 00:45:57,470
纽约人都喜欢那么说
New Yorkers like saying that.

628
00:45:59,630 --> 00:46:02,190
不过  经历了这一切
Still, after all this time, I...

629
