Thanks.

636
00:48:21,290 --> 00:48:22,650
就是一座城市而已
It's just a city.

637
00:48:25,170 --> 00:48:27,310
你会习惯看着它们倒下的
You'll get used to watching them fall.

638
00:48:53,040 --> 00:48:54,900
我们得赶紧下去  走楼梯
We gotta get down right away. Take the stairs!

639
00:48:54,910 --> 00:48:56,300
快下楼
Get down the stairs!

